header Reference: https://plantuml.com/sub-diagram

footer PlantUML GUI: https://github.com/diosaraiva/plantuml-gui

title Sub-Diagram - Activity Embedded in a Class Note

' ---- Elements ----
abstract ATest {
  {static} +String id
  {abstract} -void doit()
}

class Test {
  -int count
  -int max
  -int increment
  -void doit()
}

ATest <|-- Test

note right of Test::doit()
{{
  skinparam backgroundcolor transparent
  start

  while (count < max?)
    :count = count + increment;
  endwhile

  stop
}}
end note

@enduml